{"title":"12 years. 4 exits. 12 battle cards.","subtitle":"Screenshot-sized lessons from building startups. Save the ones you need. Send the rest to a founder friend.","doc":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"captionedImage","content":[{"type":"image2","attrs":{"src":"@@c00","fullscreen":null,"imageSize":null,"height":1350,"width":1080,"resizeWidth":null,"bytes":null,"alt":"c00","title":null,"type":"image/jpeg","href":null,"belowTheFold":false,"topImage":false,"internalRedirect":null}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I started Battle Cards years ago with one idea."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Startups are speed."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Speed means mistakes."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Learning is how you survive them."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I first wrote these as screenshot-sized essays."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"One idea. One card. Fits on a phone."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Then life got busy."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"A few companies happened."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Scapic went to Flipkart."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Cope.Studio went to Polygon."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Reality Tools went to MotionPage."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Dehidden went to Layer-E."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I'm building ShopOS."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"An AI lab that rolls up creative studios."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"So that the internet isn't full of slop."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"So it felt like the right time to bring the cards back."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"These are twelve I keep coming back to."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Each one has an insight, two reasons and three things to do."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Screenshot the ones that hit."}]},{"type":"captionedImage","content":[{"type":"image2","attrs":{"src":"@@c01","fullscreen":null,"imageSize":null,"height":1350,"width":1080,"resizeWidth":null,"bytes":null,"alt":"c01","title":null,"type":"image/jpeg","href":null,"belowTheFold":false,"topImage":false,"internalRedirect":null}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Startups are speed."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Speed means more mistakes."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Reading is not the same as getting better."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Turn one lesson into one rule, and use it before you read the next thing."}]},{"type":"captionedImage","content":[{"type":"image2","attrs":{"src":"@@c02","fullscreen":null,"imageSize":null,"height":1350,"width":1080,"resizeWidth":null,"bytes":null,"alt":"c02","title":null,"type":"image/jpeg","href":null,"belowTheFold":false,"topImage":false,"internalRedirect":null}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Every founder falls for the idea first."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Customers only ever meet the execution."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Love the problem. Date the idea."}]},{"type":"captionedImage","content":[{"type":"image2","attrs":{"src":"@@c03","fullscreen":null,"imageSize":null,"height":1350,"width":1080,"resizeWidth":null,"bytes":null,"alt":"c03","title":null,"type":"image/jpeg","href":null,"belowTheFold":false,"topImage":false,"internalRedirect":null}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Incumbents ignore toys."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"People play before they pay."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"When someone says \"that's a toy\", pay attention."}]},{"type":"captionedImage","content":[{"type":"image2","attrs":{"src":"@@c04","fullscreen":null,"imageSize":null,"height":1350,"width":1080,"resizeWidth":null,"bytes":null,"alt":"c04","title":null,"type":"image/jpeg","href":null,"belowTheFold":false,"topImage":false,"internalRedirect":null}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"One mentor can't cover your whole life."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Build a small board."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Ask them how they'd think, not what you should do."}]},{"type":"captionedImage","content":[{"type":"image2","attrs":{"src":"@@c05","fullscreen":null,"imageSize":null,"height":1350,"width":1080,"resizeWidth":null,"bytes":null,"alt":"c05","title":null,"type":"image/jpeg","href":null,"belowTheFold":false,"topImage":false,"internalRedirect":null}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Nobody is great at everything."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Copying a person copies their flaws too."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Collect traits instead. One a week."}]},{"type":"captionedImage","content":[{"type":"image2","attrs":{"src":"@@c06","fullscreen":null,"imageSize":null,"height":1350,"width":1080,"resizeWidth":null,"bytes":null,"alt":"c06","title":null,"type":"image/jpeg","href":null,"belowTheFold":false,"topImage":false,"internalRedirect":null}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Inertia is the real enemy."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"It grows inside your own walls."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Go meet people who run their days differently. Steal one habit."}]},{"type":"captionedImage","content":[{"type":"image2","attrs":{"src":"@@c07","fullscreen":null,"imageSize":null,"height":1350,"width":1080,"resizeWidth":null,"bytes":null,"alt":"c07","title":null,"type":"image/jpeg","href":null,"belowTheFold":false,"topImage":false,"internalRedirect":null}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Reflection is scary when it's vague."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"A map makes it concrete."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Project, team, company. People versus product. Past versus future."}]},{"type":"captionedImage","content":[{"type":"image2","attrs":{"src":"@@c08","fullscreen":null,"imageSize":null,"height":1350,"width":1080,"resizeWidth":null,"bytes":null,"alt":"c08","title":null,"type":"image/jpeg","href":null,"belowTheFold":false,"topImage":false,"internalRedirect":null}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Your energy tells you what your job should be."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Heart what you love. Star what others say you nail."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Cross out what drains you, and hand it to someone who loves it."}]},{"type":"captionedImage","content":[{"type":"image2","attrs":{"src":"@@c09","fullscreen":null,"imageSize":null,"height":1350,"width":1080,"resizeWidth":null,"bytes":null,"alt":"c09","title":null,"type":"image/jpeg","href":null,"belowTheFold":false,"topImage":false,"internalRedirect":null}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Short, easy work is a tool problem. Buy the tool."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Long, hard work is a people problem."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"It needs someone who keeps going."}]},{"type":"captionedImage","content":[{"type":"image2","attrs":{"src":"@@c10","fullscreen":null,"imageSize":null,"height":1350,"width":1080,"resizeWidth":null,"bytes":null,"alt":"c10","title":null,"type":"image/jpeg","href":null,"belowTheFold":false,"topImage":false,"internalRedirect":null}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Generation is cheap now."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Judgement is the scarce thing."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Make more drafts than you need. Kill most. Write down why."}]},{"type":"captionedImage","content":[{"type":"image2","attrs":{"src":"@@c11","fullscreen":null,"imageSize":null,"height":1350,"width":1080,"resizeWidth":null,"bytes":null,"alt":"c11","title":null,"type":"image/jpeg","href":null,"belowTheFold":false,"topImage":false,"internalRedirect":null}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"We named Scapic partly because the domain was free."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Half the world misspelled it."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"It still got acquired."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Names feel huge on day one. Day one thousand matters more."}]},{"type":"captionedImage","content":[{"type":"image2","attrs":{"src":"@@c12","fullscreen":null,"imageSize":null,"height":1350,"width":1080,"resizeWidth":null,"bytes":null,"alt":"c12","title":null,"type":"image/jpeg","href":null,"belowTheFold":false,"topImage":false,"internalRedirect":null}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The day after an exit feels strangely empty."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Write the playbook while it's fresh."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Then start the next thing on purpose."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"That's the set."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Next up on Battle Cards: two long essays on a question I can't stop thinking about."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"What if a brand is an RL environment?"},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"We tested it twice. Once on a cloud kitchen. Once on a car perfume."},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"text","text":"Both are rough notes, drawn by hand."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"p.s. if one of these cards helped, forward it to one founder who needs it today."}]}]},"imgs":{"c00":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/saitec/saitec/main/battle-cards/c00.jpg","c01":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/saitec/saitec/main/battle-cards/c01.jpg","c02":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/saitec/saitec/main/battle-cards/c02.jpg","c03":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/saitec/saitec/main/battle-cards/c03.jpg","c04":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/saitec/saitec/main/battle-cards/c04.jpg","c05":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/saitec/saitec/main/battle-cards/c05.jpg","c06":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/saitec/saitec/main/battle-cards/c06.jpg","c07":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/saitec/saitec/main/battle-cards/c07.jpg","c08":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/saitec/saitec/main/battle-cards/c08.jpg","c09":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/saitec/saitec/main/battle-cards/c09.jpg","c10":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/saitec/saitec/main/battle-cards/c10.jpg","c11":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/saitec/saitec/main/battle-cards/c11.jpg","c12":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/saitec/saitec/main/battle-cards/c12.jpg"}}